<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-21T13:59:58.737Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:59:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ebola has expanded to an eighth province in the DRC, prompting heightened alerts in Lubumbashi and calls for border closures. Kenyan and other long-distance truck drivers suspended DRC-bound cargo after 12 drivers were killed, leading Kenya to halt operations and Uganda to close its border over Ebola fears. Rebel groups including the FRN near Lubumbashi and the ADF in Ituri continued attacks that killed civilians and threatened regional security. The African Union is urging cease-fire compliance and inclusive dialogue. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Toronto Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5zaG9jMVBGRGZObzZ2bjRIRHRJX01CWWl1cmw4eXBrM0w4dTJEXzduSVlKNGN5RnFhWUlkWmh3clBDR2owNUtKNHo0Tll3a3BKY01HckhyYjh0ZzNRdmtQTUw4X0tUNm5FN3p5ajZmT3NCTVlq?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vox&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQcTY4LWttMmdWcFhMZ2NlSmRjRUxQZ0R4dTR1cEJsODNSYUNzQUMtNFhweXg1VmZMY0g1eE5Oc1FCZV9CWjhGSnNEZG5sNzdzVEp2UXlZX0kwakR1S3Awc2prNFFPeXIwbG5qU1JYZnZmZmtNbkV1SXV2Sk41LVVaaUN4WnZrZkV0NjBzdk5FTUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;beninwebtv.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.standardmedia.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOVmtGNnh1eEVPdVVMcjNWaDlhdGppSTVHT0ZmNEVCOTJocHVvVGUzakc2YUJFLTFWU2ZXNElyUTJXcGltdEVkNWpsakxRb052dGxMUnRVZXV2NWFiQlBOQjdILTZhZXY0el9sYU1Yci1rQXVjclUyWEc2UHJadC1TSU40RmF1b0FHR2dmbmllN3pkWmwyek85azVSVDc0cDBvenVaSw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kenyans.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQbnJVMTIxXzdldWE4SGRLUGk3MDJMYWZ4eEU3QTczeDdzdWRmN